dapo-nemo-rl patch for NeMo-RL (https://github.com/NVIDIA-NeMo/RL), base tag v0.7.0.
Adds the coreweave_hotload generation backend: a policy-only Ray cluster, the recipe's hot-load
weight synchronizer as the refit path, and GPU accounting for an external deployment.
Applied by dapo_nemo_rl/run_trainer.py with `git apply`, which skips this header.
Upstream code: Apache-2.0, NVIDIA CORPORATION.

